---
---
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split-feature">
      <div class="split-content animate-fade-up">
        <span class="label">Since Day One</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          Cooking with <span style="color: var(--orange);">care</span>,<br/>
          serving with <span style="color: var(--blue);">pride</span>.
        </h2>
        
        <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 2rem; border-radius: var(--r-lg); background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blue-soft) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);">
          <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--blue-deep); font-weight: 500;">
            The Social Kitcchen started with one simple idea: make food that tastes
            like it was cooked at home — but with the boldness of a restaurant kitchen.
          </p>
          <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            We're located in the heart of Vapi, near Pramukh Nissan on NH-48.
            Our striking blue-and-brass interiors, floral bougainvillea wall and
            mustard-yellow chairs make every visit memorable.
          </p>
          <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
            Our menu spans paneer specials, Indo-Chinese, North Indian curries,
            biryani, Italian pasta and Japanese sushi — all 100% vegetarian.
            Jain preparations are always available.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split-feature-image animate-fade-up delay-200" style="position: relative;">
        <img src="/images/interior-floral.jpg" alt="The bougainvillea wall at The Social Kitcchen" style="border-radius: var(--r-xl); box-shadow: var(--sh-xl);" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
